{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16218210","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16218210","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1621821001:1":{"text":"T-The library ghost! It's still haunting the place!","source_cn":"怨、怨灵，图书馆里的怨灵根本没走……它还在作祟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4051F9756EC0E852","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621821002:1":{"text":"Worse still, it seems to have brought along its ghost friends! The library... It's now full of ghosts! It's dangerous to go in!","source_cn":"不但没走，它还叫了不少新的同伴过来，现在图书馆里……全...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21743E8D8E84EE5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621821003:1":{"text":"Don't listen to his nonsense. I've never come across a single ghost in the library.","source_cn":"别听他瞎胡说，我就一次也没碰到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BE3A1CA9E40AD8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621821004:1":{"text":"I swear I'm not making this up! The last time it rained, I had no umbrella, so I rushed into the library for shelter. That's when I heard their spooky voices!","source_cn":"真的！上次下雨我没带伞，就在图书馆里躲了会雨，结果……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE004325049DCBB37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621821005:1":{"text":"They talked about things like \"fighting\", \"dancing\", and \"facing the trials of destiny\". It made my blood run cold!","source_cn":"而且，而且它们对话的内容越来越吓人了，还说要什么“格斗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CAF23CFADDD644C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1621821005":{"text":"They talked about things like \"fighting\", \"dancing\", and \"facing the trials of destiny\". It made my blood run cold!","source_cn":"而且，而且它们对话的内容越来越吓人了，还说要什么“格斗”，“舞蹈”，接受命运的审判什么的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CAF23CFADDD644C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621821006:1":{"text":"I know why. You cheated on the exam, and now your own guilt is driving you crazy.","source_cn":"我看你就是因为偷资料的事心虚，才会一直产生幻想，自己吓自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B99E97A131E9852","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621821007:1":{"text":"There's only one way to fix this—come clean with the professor about what you did. I'm sure you'll stop hearing things.","source_cn":"你这问题好解决。这样，你去找教授承认你自己翻了参考书，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B1F62D8FE37E674","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621821008:1":{"text":"Well...","source_cn":"这……咳咳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x785CC9A155E109B4","varia